Continuum density (CITED, Estagio 24, general K):
  f_{M_K}(x) = 2*K*x*(1 - x**2)**(K - 1)

E[M_K^1] (general K, symbolic) = sqrt(pi)*gamma(K + 1)/(2*gamma(K + 3/2))
E[M_K^2] (general K, symbolic) = 1/(K + 1)
E[M_K^3] (general K, symbolic) = 3*sqrt(pi)*gamma(K + 1)/(4*gamma(K + 5/2))

